ar's shift is substantial. Relative humidity has risen by about 0.7 points per decade, roughly 5 points since 1951, and El Niño has a strong, well-established effect toward a less humid Mar–May, and this year's shift is larger than a normal year-to-year swing. For Mar–May 2027, a warmer-than-normal season is very likely (more than 95% chance), about 0.9 °C above the 1991–2020 average; a less humid season than normal is more likely than not (about 60%). This outlook is based on the El Niño strength expected for Sep–Nov 2026 and will be updated when it is observed in early December.","variables":{"temperature":{"normal_1991_2020":28.6297,"trend_per_decade":0.1404,"trend_p":0.0,"trend_total_since_1951":1.0529,"enso_effect_per_degC":0.2415,"enso_p":0.0,"confidence":"Strong","survives_fdr":true,"fraction_explained":0.233,"intrinsic_sd":0.4107,"effect_this_season":0.5313,"effect_ratio":1.2937,"size":"Dominant","size_typical_el_nino":"Substantial","once_every_n_years_without_el_nino":10.0,"expected_anomaly_2027":0.9323,"p_below":0.0059,"p_near":0.0398,"p_above":0.9543,"forecast_words":"Very likely (>95%): a warmer-than-normal season","within_record":true,"years_of_warming_equivalent":37.8438,"values":[28.087,28.438,28.608,28.608,28.492,27.566,28.563,28.68,28.128,28.495,28.288,28.439,27.428,27.901,27.455,27.587,27.841,28.37,28.753,28.913,27.257,27.362,28.887,28.053,28.73,27.655,27.988,29.057,28.297,28.402,28.506,28.255,28.59,28.274,28.507,28.124,29.04,29.187,28.461,28.721,28.672,28.665,28.743,28.51,28.41,27.997,27.913,28.865,28.199,27.908,28.403,28.381,28.637,28.786,28.687,28.878,28.884,28.038,28.22,29.298,27.66,28.589,29.304,29.099,28.46,29.465,28.782,29.064,28.987,29.388,29.201,29.024,28.534,29.795,29.584],"forecast_mean":29.5619,"forecast_sd":0.4439,"fit":{"a2027":29.0307,"b":0.2415,"c":0.014,"tercile_low":28.4433,"tercile_high":28.8125},"percentiles":{"p05":{"trend_per_decade":0.1775,"trend_p":0.0006,"enso_effect_per_degC":0.3085,"enso_p":0.0006,"confidence":"Strong","s